<!-- The project window: for now the event display (#84) alone, filling the main window, until the docking system
     (#56) and the track list (#81) give it zones, a toolbar and track controls. ui::EventDisplay fills the element.
     The focus zone "project" has the project window's key commands, such as zooming with H and G. -->
<rml>
<head>
	<title>Project</title>
	<style>
		body
		{
			position: absolute;
			left: 0;
			top: 0;
			right: 0;
			bottom: 0;
		}

		#event-display
		{
			position: absolute;
			left: 0;
			top: 0;
			right: 0;
			bottom: 0;
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body focuszone="project">
	<div id="event-display" class="event-display"/>
</body>
</rml>
